1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Klinik Gigi masih catat rekam medis di kertas.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,760
Ini Dental Care Studio.

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:07,340
17 modul, satu aplikasi.

4
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:12,080
Dari pendaftaran front office, antrian pasian, sampai invoice.

5
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,560
Semuanya nyambung.

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,500
Tidak ada lagi buku antrian dan Excel terpisah.

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:19,940
Yang paling menonjol, odontogram digital interactive.

8
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:23,800
Klik giginya, langsung tercatat di rekam medis pasian.

9
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,860
Riwayat perawatan tersimpan rapi per gigi.

10
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,080
Komisi dokter di hitung otomatis.

11
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:32,680
Rekap kinerja staff, stok farmasi, kode promo.

12
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,960
Semua ada di dashboard analitik.

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,280
Tidak perlu hitung manual tiap akhir bulan.

14
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:41,020
Dan sudah disiapkan untuk terhubung satu sehat kemences.

15
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,460
Klinik bisa jalan dalam 30 menit setelah dipasang.

16
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:48,800
Paket hosted, 1.250.000 untuk sepuluh klinik pertama.

17
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,680
Coba demonya, tautan di deskripsi.

